PKG=dlmkit46
NAME=dlmkit46 k46.1.3.261031-12.96720ad - the ABI kit for k46 kernel modules
ARCH=Amiga
VERSION=k46.1.3.261031-12.96720ad
CATEGORY=development
CLASSES=none
VENDOR=amix-packages
PSTAMP=amix-packages-dlmkit46-k46.1.3.261031-12.96720ad
# USERLAND (amix-dlm S3-22): an ordinary catalog entry, no kpkg entry, no
# apkg kernel-space record, no catalog dependency.  VERSION is the kit's
# kabi tag, the kit date, the package revision, then KIT_REV.
APKG_DESC=The ABI kit for k46 (68040/68060) kernel modules, kabi k46.1.3: headers, DDI lists, registries, module tools, make fragment, sample, docs (/usr/dlm/kit/k46)
DESC=The amix-dlm ABI kit for the k46 line (kabi k46.1.3, KIT_REV 96720ad): the module headers (mod.h, moddefs.h, ksym.h, amixddi.h, monsw.h), the stock Amix 2.1 kernel headers (immu.h and param.h in the 040/060 port's 4 KiB page forms), the DDI v1 allowlists, the major and probe registries, mkmod, modfix, modcheck.py, mkabi.py, the make fragment, the sample module and the module guide.  A module is built on a host with the pinned gcc-cross-amix and Python 3 (tools/modfix is a Linux x86-64 program).  MIT, with Commodore's headers under the 2026-09-23 distribution permission (NOTICE).
